          "Initial release of the Nosh specification",
          "Defined 10 content types: article, tutorial, api-reference, product, recipe, faq, changelog, dataset, event, profile",
          "Defined 4 discovery mechanisms with priority order",
          "Published JSON Schema (draft 2020-12)",
          "Released Rust validator CLI",
          "Released Zola template for static site generation"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
